<title>USA: American Business to buy County Data.</title>
<headline>American Business to buy County Data.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Business Information Inc, a provider of business data, said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to buy  County Data Corp, a national compiler of new business databases.</p>
<p>County Data compiles its databases from business licenses, incorporations, trade name registrations and other public sources. More than 1.5 million new business names are captured every year from such sources.</p>
<p>County Data expects calendar 1996 revenues of about $4.5 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
